        "subject": "LU-21319 build: prevent lbuild ERR trap recursion",
        "message": "LU-21319 build: prevent lbuild ERR trap recursion\n\nWith \"set -E\" the ERR trap is inherited by the subshell that the\ntrap itself spawns.  If a command in that subshell fails, e.g. an\necho after the Jenkins build was aborted and stdout was closed,\nthe trap re-enters endlessly, forking until the node runs out of\nmemory and panics.\n\nClear the ERR trap at the start of the trap's subshell.\n\nTest-Parameters: trivial\nChange-Id: Ic11ff1449abb3028808ad401c8086a5988db6b51\nSigned-off-by: Charlie Olmstead <charlie@whamcloud.com>\nAssisted-by: Augment:claude-opus-5-5\n"
      },
      "branch": "refs/heads/master"
    }
  },
